From 49046126b121be8b30895a636a1d98ad62531b26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanila Chowdhury <sanilachowdhury@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:07:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Turn portfolio into one scrolling page with fixed backdrop
 and scroll animations

- All sections on one page: Home, Skills, Experience, Projects, About, Contact
- Fixed gradient backdrop with drifting blobs that sections scroll over
- Fade-up reveal on scroll for headings and cards
- Experience timeline line fills as you scroll; roses bloom as you pass them
- Navbar links scroll to sections and highlight the current one
- Old routes (/projects etc.) still work and jump to their section

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KShcqxq9dapwnFQatmHQ7U
